    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Getting on, getting off and changing",
     "texto": [
      "**Gå på** means to get on a vehicle and **gå av**, to get off. **Bytte tog** means to change trains; **bytte buss**, to change buses.",
      "**Plattform** is the platform; **spor** is the track. At stations, the track number shows where the train leaves from."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
